<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="km">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>បទចម្រៀងបង្កើតដោយ AI - Sideth 99</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Khmer OS Battambang', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #0f172a;
            color: #f8fafc;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .header-section {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .header-section h5 {
            font-size: 28px;
            color: #38bdf8;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4);
        }

        .header-section span {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #94a3b8;
        }

        .project-item {
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.7);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .project-item:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            border-color: #38bdf8;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25);
        }

        .btn-youtube {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 15px;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ef4444, #dc2626);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);
        }

        .btn-youtube:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f87171, #ef4444);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.6);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header-section">
            <h5>🎵 បបទចម្រៀងបង្កើតដោយ AI 🎶</h5>
            <span>ស្តាប់កម្សាន្តនូវបទចម្រៀងពិរោះៗដែលច្នៃប្រឌិតឡើងដោយបញ្ញាសិប្បនិម្មិត (AI)។</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Project Item -->
        <div class="project-item">
            <h3>ភ្លើងក្រហមនៅចុងផ្លូវ</h3>
            <p style="color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 15px;">បទចម្រៀងថ្មីสุดស៊ីអារម្មណ៍ ច្នៃប្រឌិតដោយ AI ផ្ទាល់ខ្លួនរបស់ Deth DSN។</p>
            <a href="https://youtube.com/@sideth99?si=tKlXlGyBVWxpAR6C" target="_blank" class="btn-youtube">▶ ស្តាប់នៅលើ YouTube</a>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>


